 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nGroupe Horizon SA                                              MASTER SERVICES\n12 Rue de la République, 75008 Paris, France                   AGREEMENT\nN° TVA: FR63 735441326\n\nFROM                                                          FACTURÉ À\nGroupe Horizon SA                                             Société Lumière SARL\n12 Rue de la République                                       12 Rue de la République\n75008 Paris                                                   69001 Lyon\nFrance                                                        France\nVAT: FR63 735441326\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 23/05/2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and between Groupe Horizon\nSA, with its registered office at 12 Rue de la République, Paris (\"Party A\"), and Société Lumière SARL, with its registered office at 12 Rue\nde la République, Lyon (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 36 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in accordance with\nSection 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the purposes of this\nAgreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of Switzerland.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A      Groupe Horizon SA / Sophie Bernard\nParty B      Société Lumière SARL / Sophie Bernard\nDate         23/05/2026",
